Frequently Asked Questions about Metrobi

How is Metrobi different from other courier and delivery platforms?

Most delivery platforms send whoever is available — a random driver, every single time. You don't get to choose. You don't know who's coming. And you have no guarantee they'll get out of the car when you need a proper hand-off.

That's not acceptable when your business reputation is on the line.

With Metrobi, you decide who delivers for you. You set your standards. You stay in control — from the moment a driver accepts your job to the moment it's completed.

It's not a dispatch service. It's a platform built around giving your business the tools to run deliveries your way.

